Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 06:14:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] perf(monitor): add exact TerminalState comparison

Add TerminalState.isSameAs, which reports whether two states would be
written to identical network payloads (colour flag, presence, size and
the encoded terminal bytes), and test it against the encoded form.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
